  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note records the decision that auth-gateway tokens will expire after 15 minutes instead of an hour, and when was it written?\n[2026-01-22] standup/atlas/2026-01-22: Auth-gateway tokens will expire after 15 minutes instead of an hour. Rationale: the security audit flagged long-lived tokens. [2025-08-01] incident-review/INC-2025-017: Review of INC-2025-017 (the auth gateway, 2025-07-27). The root cause was an expired intermediate certificate. We decided that certificate expiry will alert 30 days ahead, because an expired intermediate certificate took logins down in INC-2025-017. [2025-08-14] standup/boreal/2025-08-14: Changes to auth-gateway need two reviewer approvals and a security sign-off.",
